msgid ""
"按时启动：到达设定时间后，直接启动当前任务。\n"
"链式启动：不会单独按时间触发，需要放在前一个任务后面；当前一个任务正常结束后，会按列表顺序立即启动。\n"
"立即运行：从当前任务开始，后面连续的链式任务也会跟随执行。"
msgstr ""
"Time-based Start: starts this task directly when the scheduled time is reached.\n"
"Chained Start: does not trigger by time on its own. Place it after a previous task, and it will start immediately in list order after that task finishes normally.\n"
"Run Now: starts from the current task, and any consecutive chained tasks after it will run as well."

