#: app/setting_interface.py:2905
msgid "匿名使用数据收集说明"
msgstr "Anonymous Usage Data Collection Details"

#: app/setting_interface.py:2906
msgid ""
"我们只收集用于改进稳定性、兼容性和功能体验的匿名统计信息，不用于识别你的真实身份，也不会用于广告、画像或与第三方共享。\n"
"\n"
"不会上传账号、密码、截图、游戏画面、文件内容或原始错误文本。错误相关信息会在本地处理后，仅以上报错误类型或匿名指纹的形式发送。\n"
"\n"
"当前可能收集的内容包括：程序版本、系统类型、界面语言、OCR 模式、部分功能开关与通知偏好配置快照、任务执行结果，以及匿名化后的错误信息。\n"
"\n"
"这些数据仅用于分析功能使用情况、发现兼容性问题、评估版本稳定性和排查共性故障。"
msgstr ""
"We only collect anonymous statistical data used to improve stability, compatibility, and feature experience. It is not used to identify your real identity, nor is it used for advertising, profiling, or shared with third parties.\n"
"\n"
"Account credentials, screenshots, gameplay images, file contents, and raw error text are never uploaded. Error-related data is processed locally first and is only sent as an error type or anonymous fingerprint.\n"
"\n"
"Collected data may include: app version, system type, UI language, OCR mode, snapshots of selected feature switches and notification preferences, task execution results, and anonymized error information.\n"
"\n"
"This data is used only to analyze feature usage, discover compatibility issues, evaluate version stability, and investigate common problems."

